WEBVTT

01:24.753 --> 01:29.057
LAZARUS

01:32.461 --> 01:33.462
Are you serious?

01:33.823 --> 01:35.684
23 years old, does she look like this?

01:35.857 --> 01:36.733
Why does it sound like satire?

01:37.034 --> 01:40.200
I think Axel at least
28 years old.

01:40.244 --> 01:41.621
Does that mean it applies to me too?

01:41.764 --> 01:42.528
Huh?

01:42.704 --> 01:44.144
Doug is also 23?

01:44.318 --> 01:45.185
Yes

01:45.272 --> 01:47.764
Eh, that's hard to believe.

01:47.893 --> 01:50.751
I thought you were in your 40s.

01:50.944 --> 01:51.874
40 years?

01:52.029 --> 01:53.762
How old is Chris himself?

01:53.925 --> 01:54.745
30 years?

01:54.790 --> 01:56.693
Stupid!
I didn't say that!

01:56.718 --> 01:58.205
Approximately 26 years?

01:59.682 --> 02:01.479
I won't say.

02:01.538 --> 02:04.112
If I answer, you'll be able to guess.

02:04.151 --> 02:05.627
There was just a response.

02:05.667 --> 02:06.811
So my guess was right.

02:06.835 --> 02:09.265
From now on,
I will call you Brother Chris.

02:09.338 --> 02:11.393
Don't call me that, okay?

02:11.462 --> 02:13.925
By the way, I'm 16 years old.

02:14.760 --> 02:16.432
Annoying kid.

02:16.531 --> 02:18.862
Ouch, it hurts! Stop!

02:18.909 --> 02:19.869
40 years...

02:21.484 --> 02:22.440
Finished.

02:22.621 --> 02:24.850
What's that?

02:24.900 --> 02:27.252
He happened to find it
in the armory.

02:27.585 --> 02:30.244
He thought that this tool
can be used for barbecue.

02:30.360 --> 02:32.502
Eh, is that really why?

02:32.736 --> 02:33.630
40 years...

02:33.887 --> 02:34.721
I start!

02:42.744 --> 02:43.917
What happened?

02:49.329 --> 02:50.219
Fire?

02:51.088 --> 02:52.283
How could it be.

02:53.526 --> 02:56.964
#7: ALMOST BLUE

02:56.989 --> 02:58.661
THE LAST LARGE ICE BEAR IN ANTARCTICA
STARTING TO COLLAPSE

02:58.714 --> 03:02.881
<i>Today, the last large iceberg</i>
<i>in Antarctica collapsed.</i>

03:03.111 --> 03:04.513
Good grief.

03:04.538 --> 03:07.017
Eh, Antarctica is finally disappearing?

03:07.145 --> 03:09.106
All television channels are broadcasting this.

03:09.439 --> 03:11.041
Take a look at this.

03:11.108 --> 03:12.846
It's currently going viral on the internet.

03:12.871 --> 03:13.212
OH MY GOD SKINNER'S PREDICTION IS REAL

03:13.237 --> 03:14.782
<i>According to my calculations,</i>

03:15.156 --> 03:16.976
<i>three years from now...</i>

03:17.159 --> 03:17.633
IS THIS THE END OF HUMANITY?

03:17.658 --> 03:20.327
<i>...the ice in Antarctica will melt and disappear!</i>

03:20.843 --> 03:24.264
Today is exactly three years
from the date of his speech.

03:24.309 --> 03:24.952
Are you serious?

03:25.029 --> 03:28.078
Will the world be like Skinner predicted?

03:28.171 --> 03:31.508
Some even call it
as God or a fortune teller.

03:31.770 --> 03:34.569
Even though yesterday he was just called a terrorist.

03:34.717 --> 03:39.201
Not only that, most likely
the third world war will break out.

03:39.357 --> 03:41.282
Hapna has been a problem lately.

03:41.478 --> 03:42.516
That's right.

03:43.022 --> 03:44.203
According to his statement,

03:44.670 --> 03:47.750
the first victim will appear
in 15 days.

03:48.249 --> 03:51.854
It is possible that humans will be destroyed first
because war broke out.

03:51.939 --> 03:53.816
That's not funny.

03:55.215 --> 03:56.216
Herschel.

03:56.869 --> 03:58.096
Sorry to keep you waiting.

03:58.352 --> 03:59.289
Let's start.

04:01.066 --> 04:04.222
It's a shame, but our investigation
back to the beginning.

04:04.943 --> 04:08.677
The FBI breaking into the Tower of Truth...

04:08.746 --> 04:11.964
...didn't find anything
related to Skinner.

04:12.508 --> 04:16.617
The dragon is an imitation mind assembled
based on Skinner's brain model...

04:17.044 --> 04:20.717
...but it has already been established that
have no relation whatsoever to him.

04:20.781 --> 04:22.346
Waste of time, huh.

04:22.408 --> 04:24.072
Now what should we do?

04:24.154 --> 04:27.158
At times like these,
we have to go back to basics.

04:27.267 --> 04:28.135
Base?

04:28.362 --> 04:30.858
First, let's examine the motive for the crime again.

04:30.907 --> 04:31.783
Huh?

04:35.057 --> 04:36.782
It's useless, it can't be eaten.

04:38.779 --> 04:43.205
I don't mean to jump to conclusions.
human fitness to live.

04:43.925 --> 04:47.943
I'm just the seventh trumpeter.

04:48.018 --> 04:48.797
A moment.

04:49.985 --> 04:53.252
What does the seventh trumpet mean?

04:53.471 --> 04:55.333
It's a New Testament sheet.

04:55.627 --> 04:58.474
That's the Book of Revelation
written by John...

04:58.570 --> 05:01.841
...after God showed
future to him.

05:02.011 --> 05:03.596
What does the future look like?

05:03.840 --> 05:06.718
Volcanic eruptions, meteor falls,
war, and so on.

05:07.182 --> 05:08.862
In the Book of Revelation,

05:09.001 --> 05:11.508
God is angry with arrogant humans...

05:11.580 --> 05:13.852
...so that He brings
all kinds of disasters.

05:13.940 --> 05:15.082
Scary!

05:15.197 --> 05:17.342
Not much different from the current conditions.

05:17.539 --> 05:21.313
Angels blow trumpets in succession
to give news.

05:21.835 --> 05:24.832
Then, the time of the seventh angel
blow the trumpet,

05:25.009 --> 05:27.937
the final judgment will be passed
on mankind.

05:28.036 --> 05:29.555
That's how it is.

05:29.580 --> 05:32.466
Hence, Skinner calls himself
as the conclusion of the seventh trumpet.

05:34.376 --> 05:35.252
It's finished.

05:36.143 --> 05:37.126
Ah, wait for me.

05:37.745 --> 05:41.573
Hey, when is the first trumpet?
until the sixth is blown?

05:42.363 --> 05:43.610
Who knows.

05:45.970 --> 05:46.833
Okay.

05:47.362 --> 05:48.733
Analysis complete.

05:54.995 --> 05:56.542
Today, the weather is bad.

05:56.940 --> 05:59.055
The sun will also set soon.

05:59.437 --> 06:01.915
If you want to go by ship,
wouldn't it be better tomorrow?

06:02.215 --> 06:03.138
Just now.

06:03.247 --> 06:04.104
But...

06:04.365 --> 06:07.943
We can't trust tomorrow.

06:14.812 --> 06:15.955
What's this?

06:16.111 --> 06:18.299
The memory I took from the Dragon.

06:18.553 --> 06:19.488
What number is this?

06:19.622 --> 06:22.600
Maybe the last number
which is displayed by the Dragon.

06:22.846 --> 06:24.873
Some kind of Dragon death message?

06:25.093 --> 06:28.658
Maybe he wants to say something.

06:28.746 --> 06:30.998
It may be the contents
the name of his first heart's desire.

06:31.057 --> 06:32.555
Think seriously.

06:32.704 --> 06:34.349
Yes, yes, Chairman.

06:34.478 --> 06:35.997
Maybe a phone number.

06:36.361 --> 06:38.531
Let me try calling.

06:38.653 --> 06:40.363
Uh, right away?

06:40.637 --> 06:42.668
Maybe this is also some kind of code.

06:42.915 --> 06:44.714
I'll put it into the solving program.

06:45.033 --> 06:47.507
It could be a coordinate point on a map.

06:47.886 --> 06:49.658
Huh? A ramen shop?

06:50.077 --> 06:51.804
Sorry, wrong connection.

06:51.917 --> 06:54.961
"Have a nice bath everyone..."

06:55.159 --> 06:56.147
What's that?

06:56.255 --> 06:57.798
I don't understand what that means.

06:59.446 --> 07:00.414
Bingo.

07:01.937 --> 07:04.827
That's what coordinates mean
latitude and longitude?

07:04.967 --> 07:05.718
Correct.

07:05.904 --> 07:09.666
This is the UTM that is often used
in the military.

07:11.420 --> 07:12.712
The coordinates are at these four locations.

07:15.414 --> 07:16.604
Hmm...

07:16.645 --> 07:17.726
Is this correct?

07:17.992 --> 07:20.038
If it is correct,
why is the location in the middle of the sea?

07:21.495 --> 07:25.780
Maldives, Manila Bay,
Sakishima Islands, Tuvalu.

07:26.297 --> 07:27.465
I do not understand.

07:28.198 --> 07:29.292
Isn't this...

07:29.414 --> 07:32.149
...the sinking islands
within ten years?

07:32.338 --> 07:33.575
That is true.

07:33.668 --> 07:37.067
That means it wasn't a sea before,
but island!

07:37.361 --> 07:39.055
Maybe this is...

07:40.659 --> 07:41.702
I already guessed.

07:42.399 --> 07:46.671
Skinner bought these four islands
just before it sank.

07:46.924 --> 07:47.948
Skinner?

07:48.105 --> 07:49.748
He took the trouble to buy
an island about to sink.

07:50.199 --> 07:52.468
Dragon wants to convey that?

07:52.742 --> 07:55.795
Oh, I'm so confused!

07:55.969 --> 07:58.034
Won't start
if it's just an argument!

07:58.575 --> 08:01.482
Let's take a look at Skinner's sea.

08:03.917 --> 08:08.188
Is there any possibility that Skinner
hiding in one of those locations?

08:08.439 --> 08:10.368
<i>I can't promise anything.</i>

08:10.636 --> 08:15.724
<i>But, Skinner must have had his reasons.</i>
<i>for buying the island.</i>

08:16.182 --> 08:17.225
That's how it is.

08:17.768 --> 08:21.563
<i>But, the island sank to the bottom of the sea</i>
<i>due to global warming.</i>

08:22.037 --> 08:24.331
<i>There are only a few clues left.</i>

08:24.777 --> 08:25.778
I understand.

08:26.438 --> 08:30.717
Then, can you come out for a moment?

08:50.072 --> 08:54.446
LAZARUS

08:55.869 --> 08:58.979
I don't know
if you like Rembrandt.

08:59.259 --> 09:02.956
Or wherever you want to go
as long as it's not tapped?

09:03.106 --> 09:03.857
No.

09:03.961 --> 09:06.241
I decided long ago that...

09:06.293 --> 09:08.362
...the last painting I saw
is Rembrandt.

09:08.555 --> 09:10.302
Quite emotional.

09:10.634 --> 09:12.248
That's who I am.

09:12.698 --> 09:15.306
You who are calm, serene,
and cold-blooded...

09:15.585 --> 09:18.979
...even suspected of being an imitation mind?

09:20.075 --> 09:21.753
I just heard all that.

09:26.342 --> 09:27.680
I'll be back in an hour.

09:28.926 --> 09:29.614
Abel.

09:30.360 --> 09:32.447
Don't let your work be disturbed.

09:33.448 --> 09:35.167
I know, Liz.

09:36.867 --> 09:38.527
See you in an hour!

09:58.035 --> 10:03.540
MANILA, PHILIPPINES

10:03.561 --> 10:07.890
ROAD CLOSED

11:02.557 --> 11:06.254
MALDIVES

11:35.507 --> 11:38.260
ISHIGAKI ISLAND, JAPAN

11:38.285 --> 11:40.752
ISHIGAKI ISLAND
DREAM TOURISM

11:40.776 --> 11:43.768
INFORMATION
DESTINATION, SCHEDULE

11:43.793 --> 11:46.174
GUIDE MAP

11:52.921 --> 11:54.581
MINIMUM OF TEN GUESTS

11:54.589 --> 11:56.925
TICKET COUNTER

12:06.329 --> 12:09.082
FIJI

12:13.358 --> 12:15.596
CLASSIC ELECTRIC BOAT
BUY NOW

12:15.621 --> 12:16.026
THANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE
ORDER SUMMARY

12:54.252 --> 12:55.772
Here is the Maldives ship.

12:55.921 --> 12:58.100
I arrived at the coordinate point
12 minutes left.

12:58.842 --> 13:01.637
<i>I've been there too</i>
<i>over the Santa Maria River.</i>

13:02.608 --> 13:04.010
I'll land in a moment.

13:05.369 --> 13:07.413
I just got out of Ishigaki Island.

13:08.066 --> 13:10.109
I will arrive at Taketomi Island
within ten minutes.

13:10.831 --> 13:13.257
I have arrived in Tuvalu.

13:14.120 --> 13:17.000
I try to see the view
underwater first, okay?

13:17.032 --> 13:18.850
TUVALU

13:25.957 --> 13:27.083
What's that?

13:30.603 --> 13:31.317
Here?

13:31.520 --> 13:33.694
Yes, that's right.

13:35.087 --> 13:37.009
As expected, nothing happened.

13:50.019 --> 13:50.980
That...

13:51.060 --> 13:53.142
It doesn't matter, though.

13:53.673 --> 13:56.879
But, will Lazarus be disbanded?
after Skinner was arrested?

13:57.205 --> 13:58.373
<i>Of course.</i>

13:58.598 --> 14:01.175
<i>This team was formed with that purpose.</i>

14:01.903 --> 14:05.485
It feels a bit wasteful, doesn't it?

14:06.233 --> 14:09.371
<i>Does that mean we don't need to catch Skinner?</i>

14:09.682 --> 14:12.515
<i>Hey, hey.</i>
<i>The world could be destroyed, you know!</i>

14:12.562 --> 14:15.548
<i>No, no. I understand!</i>

14:47.032 --> 14:50.160
TAKETOMI ISLAND, JAPAN

15:49.491 --> 15:54.140
I forgot
if the sea and sky are blue.

15:54.710 --> 15:57.814
<i>I've been here for a long time</i>
<i>not seeing the blue sky.</i>

15:57.958 --> 16:01.186
<i>Weather in Babylon City</i>
<i>it's always cloudy, though.</i>

16:01.503 --> 16:03.514
<i>Now, the conditions are the same</i>
<i>throughout the city.</i>

16:04.401 --> 16:07.500
The beautiful place is
a place untouched by humans.

16:08.773 --> 16:13.367
<i>Could it be that Skinner wanted to demonstrate this?</i>

16:38.526 --> 16:39.540
<i>This is it...</i>

16:40.027 --> 16:42.221
<i>...the true form of the earth.</i>

16:44.059 --> 16:47.135
<i>The humans who destroyed it.</i>

16:48.411 --> 16:52.242
<i>The six gongs</i>
<i>has been blown for a long time.</i>

16:54.994 --> 16:59.435
<i>Who decides</i>
<i>if Skinner is wrong?</i>

17:03.974 --> 17:05.059
How?

17:05.589 --> 17:06.808
There isn't anything.

17:08.278 --> 17:10.104
It's been ten years...

17:10.517 --> 17:13.377
...since the inhabitants of this island
move to another island.

17:15.008 --> 17:15.884
On your cheek.

17:17.113 --> 17:20.362
There was a flying fish that hit me earlier.

17:20.569 --> 17:21.787
Doesn't it hurt?

17:22.131 --> 17:26.044
Since birth, I have been immune to illness.

17:26.398 --> 17:27.158
Huh?

17:27.367 --> 17:30.162
I never felt any pain.

17:31.738 --> 17:33.466
Does that mean you don't drink Hapna?

17:33.637 --> 17:35.583
I don't need to, though.

17:35.959 --> 17:39.376
Around here, immune to pain
is a normal thing.

17:40.561 --> 17:41.489
<i>What is it?</i>

17:41.685 --> 17:46.838
Then, most of the island's residents
also immune to pain.

17:47.126 --> 17:47.894
What?

17:47.985 --> 17:51.150
<i>My guide was a former islander...</i>

17:51.319 --> 17:53.310
<i>...and he really is</i>
<i>feel no pain.</i>

17:53.454 --> 17:57.589
<i>Then, Skinner comes to the island.</i>
<i>when he was little.</i>

17:57.847 --> 17:59.520
We have no money.

17:59.807 --> 18:01.807
It is impossible to move to another area.

18:02.165 --> 18:05.967
But, thanks to Skinner who bought
the whole island,

18:06.105 --> 18:09.825
<i>so we can start a new life.</i>

18:10.317 --> 18:14.098
Eleina, can you investigate?
cash flow to other islands?

18:14.536 --> 18:15.495
<i>I will try.</i>

18:17.598 --> 18:18.591
Unlucky!

18:19.141 --> 18:21.573
What the heck is Skinner?

18:24.151 --> 18:28.054
Rembrandt is called an artist
who discovered the light.

18:28.636 --> 18:32.087
That means, we can only
see the true form of something...

18:32.240 --> 18:36.053
...depends on how we do it
shine its light.

18:36.432 --> 18:40.187
Then what do you want to talk about?
to invite me here?

18:43.216 --> 18:45.760
I feel guilty towards you.

18:46.479 --> 18:47.271
Why?

18:47.955 --> 18:54.714
If you think I'm taking advantage
your feelings for Skinner, that's your right.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.954
You don't need to think about it.

18:57.494 --> 18:59.500
Nobody forced me.

18:59.998 --> 19:01.791
I decided it myself.

19:03.074 --> 19:04.367
That's right.

19:05.348 --> 19:08.156
Why did he start this?

19:08.787 --> 19:12.119
Why did he go alone?
and leave me?

19:12.609 --> 19:14.527
I want to know the answer to that question.

19:16.162 --> 19:18.096
Arizona Prison Problems...

19:18.639 --> 19:21.308
...is being investigated by
Army Intelligence Agency.

19:21.632 --> 19:22.651
About Axel?

19:22.927 --> 19:23.868
Correct.

19:24.087 --> 19:27.224
Then, the accident case
at Schiphol Airport too.

19:28.502 --> 19:32.670
Axel is a shining light
for this case.

19:34.299 --> 19:35.857
15 years ago,

19:35.971 --> 19:38.717
Skinner came to this island
and take DNA samples.

19:39.705 --> 19:41.325
It's the same on the other three islands.

19:41.518 --> 19:43.578
Thanks to Skinner buying their island,

19:43.773 --> 19:47.158
residents can start living
in new areas.

19:47.707 --> 19:52.218
<i>Whatever the reason, the DNA sample was</i>
<i>possibly related to Hapna.</i>

19:52.249 --> 19:52.860
STUDY ON PREVALENCE
AND THE GENETIC BASIS OF CONGENITAL ANALGESIA

19:52.900 --> 19:55.087
TO THE INDIGENOUS POPULATION OF THE MALDIVES
<i>Where is the DNA research located?</i>

19:55.362 --> 19:59.324
<i>At that time, Doctor Skinner worked together</i>
<i>with The Haggis Research Centre.</i>

19:59.607 --> 20:03.255
<i>That place should be closed</i>
<i>since the Hapna incident.</i>

20:03.620 --> 20:06.206
I will look for identity
researchers at that time.

20:07.076 --> 20:10.037
Maybe Dragon wants to know.

20:10.373 --> 20:11.097
<i>What?</i>

20:11.522 --> 20:16.027
What did Skinner do that he considered
as a father in this place.

20:16.479 --> 20:21.843
We are like exploring things
which Skinner has done.

20:22.436 --> 20:25.874
<i>Maybe that was the goal.</i>

20:26.072 --> 20:27.113
<i>What do you mean?</i>

20:27.511 --> 20:31.157
<i>He wants us to feel</i>
<i>the same thing with him.</i>

20:33.114 --> 20:38.133
We are still dancing in the palm of his hand.

20:45.738 --> 20:47.626
The Resurrection of Lazarus?

20:48.065 --> 20:49.579
Tell me one thing.

20:50.328 --> 20:55.333
From your point of view,
Did Skinner sell his soul to the devil?

20:56.781 --> 20:57.601
No.

20:57.908 --> 20:59.675
He hasn't changed at all.

21:00.690 --> 21:04.830
Since the beginning, he has always been sincere.

21:05.579 --> 21:07.883
"You won't be able to survive.
in this world."

21:08.030 --> 21:10.241
When I said that,
he answered...

21:10.992 --> 21:15.318
"What's wrong with researchers?
want to be sincere?"

21:16.991 --> 21:18.200
Oh, I see.

21:18.592 --> 21:24.390
What I believe is
he also hopes to be found.

21:25.195 --> 21:28.061
I want to believe that too.

21:30.310 --> 21:31.936
I found the archive.

21:32.304 --> 21:34.732
List of researchers at The Hague facility.

21:34.811 --> 21:36.875
DR. HERSCH LINDEMANN
NEUROLOGIST

21:36.908 --> 21:37.563
DR. HERSCH LINDEMANN
RESEARCH SCIENTIST

21:37.599 --> 21:38.266
Huh?

21:38.618 --> 21:39.411
What is it?

21:39.986 --> 21:42.324
Here's how...

21:43.926 --> 21:45.011
Why?

22:09.147 --> 22:10.520
Alexandra?

22:11.456 --> 22:12.490
That is true.

22:15.563 --> 22:18.816
14 DAYS REMAINING

23:50.032 --> 23:54.954
NEXT EPISODE:
UNFORGETTABLE FIRE
